# Device-specific configuration and secrets: examples are intentionally tracked.
**/pico_config.json
**/secrets.yaml
**/secrets.yml
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*token*.txt
**/*credentials*

# Device runtime files and recovery/maintenance state.
**/boot_state.json
**/last_crash.json
**/baseline.json
**/dryer_state.json
**/washer_state.json
**/maintenance.flag
**/*.tmp
**/*.log

# Private backups, archives, generated bytecode, editor metadata.
**/backups/
**/*backup*
**/*.bak
**/*.zip
**/*.uf2
**/*.mpy
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
.venv/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
